      "englishName": "Guided Roleplay",
      "chineseName": "引导式角色扮演",
      "definition": "让用户在多轮、有变化的对话中维持输出，处理“对方不按剧本说话”的情况。这是从“会说一句”到“能对话”的关键一步。",
      "sourceId": "WBA-SKILLS-S01-S12",
      "sourceLocator": "received/original/WA/1-IndoBrain-AI-Teaching-Skills-V1.md:801-804",
